{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nounishpunk is a fast-paced third-person action-adventure game with open-world exploration and skateboarding. Inspired by Sunset Overdrive, Ratchet &amp; Clank, and Batman.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a vibrant futuristic city, fight enemies with ridiculous weapons, and master high-speed movement. No filler, no hand-holding\u2014just pure gameplay. Despite its colorful art style, it\u2019s designed for players who love skill-based action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime: 10-15h</strong>. <strong>Try the demo now!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Roam freely in a lively cyberpunk city filled with missions and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Motorized Skateboarding:</strong> Experience high-speed movement and fluid traversal across the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/ezgif-6-7337d2e442.gif?t=1741768945\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique &amp; Ridiculous Weapons:</strong> Engage in fast-paced combat with a variety of over-the-top weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/ezgif-2-1800d3f60d.gif?t=1741768945\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Captivating Futuristic Art Style:</strong> A visually stunning world with a unique sci-fi aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/ezgif-4-5a22245ff8.gif?t=1741768945\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><stron